			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2693056">
									

<p>For me, it's not about the robot never getting to see it's little abominations born. It's closer to the feeling I get looking at pictures of <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pripyat">Pripyat</a>&#8230;a sort of &quot;Look on my works, ye mighty, and despair.&quot; thing mixed with the sort of pity you feel for a rabid animal. The fact that it isn't truely sapient actually makes it more pathetic to me, to be honest- it doesn't know anything but what that disk tells it.</p>

